    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Steve Fossey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116305492407456697123/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6pGpRP4aXBZz9v30PGHhOrovDOhR6y5_VwD_zTDRngkQI2mAJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "My family's experience with this place has been excellent. Private health care is very important.",
        "time": 1767024816,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Katherine Watt",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101787260159162098413/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI29pNbsHBrxX_s6gRQrFYAsQgPE5r75SrA--9vZNnEctNmLw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Absolutely horrible clinic! They never answer the phone and you can't even leave a message. They don't answer emails. Impossible to get appointments. When you do get an appointment, all the doctor wants to do is write you a prescription and that is after being late to see you.",
        "time": 1729276417,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Petra Rajewski",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111106186045429197857/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZNECwFE4Uecf3b9Ask-wi92qPUdytcjKuHiYxDOxi8ZcmWQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "After an appointment nearly two weeks ago, I've been waiting patiently to receive a referral from my family doctor (which I had to argue for in the first place), who assured me it would be sent to me via email. Since then I have been checking my email(s) regularly and asking any family members if it had been accidentally sent to their emails – nothing.\nAs I had some time, I finally decided to call the clinic to ask them to remind my doctor to send the referral, and what do I encounter? A phone service that does not allow you to leave a voicemail, and a system that asks you to wait for an agent, before promptly stating that there are no agents available to take your call and to call back later. As I also had the clinic's email, I attempted to send an email to them to which I received a bounce-back email stating that they do not receive emails, and that you need to call them directly. They also listed an additional email at the bottom of this statement, so I tried sending an email to that email, because why else would they list it unless you can EMAIL them? Well as my experiences have set me up for, I get another bounce-back email with the exact same statement.\nI don't think I have ever been livid before but this experience has been nothing if not infuriating.\nIf it weren't a cost issue, I would simply go private because my experience with public healthcare these past few years has been a joke, and I'm fed up, so thank you Clinique de la Cite for being the damn boulder that broke the camel's back.",
        "time": 1708017016,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Luca Colonnese",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104478083558708625077/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnwH2VbwFQLtXYViia_AFctWLE-6UTMdei0c8N8OMfh5mp4Vw90w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Doctor is not terrible but it's impossible to reach them for anything. All appointments have to be taken on line at the Quebec website. Then you see your doctor, she tells you to call her in case of questions and when you call the only message available (recorded) is that they are unable to take your call and you cannot leave a message, please call back later. No matter how many times you call the message is always the same. Other than showing up in person there is no way to reach them. Useless...",
        "time": 1677617816,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tony McFarlane",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114820859983382453619/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI1yoXAkwg9YgnChNsgG7Nl3EcFev5Kq9aHbWFaA8vbZwU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Clinic called me to schedule an appointment on referral from my GP and gave a number to call back. I have been calling every day for more than two weeks and message each time says to call back later.  Frustrating and not impressed.",
        "time": 1681841868,
        "translated": false
      }
